        "created_at": "2017-01-19T05:06:06.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>As to your question regarding Sky-Scraper, if you play Neutralizer Resonator instead of something that makes you Tiny, and then use her base power to draw 2, you'll draw Tectonic Chokeslam literally on turn 1.</p><p>Personally, I almost always keep SS in normal for a few turns to build up a large hand. &nbsp;In this, game, since Ermine had already make some folks discard, it seemed like a must, and the only link I wanted in play was Resonator for use with ongoing destruction.</p>",
