        "created_at": "2017-01-19T08:50:33.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"broccoli\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/broccoli/48/1861_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> broccoli:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>As to your question regarding Sky-Scraper, if you play Neutralizer Resonator instead of something that makes you Tiny, and then use her base power to draw 2, you'll draw Tectonic Chokeslam literally on turn 1.Personally, I almost always keep SS in normal for a few turns to build up a large hand. &nbsp;In this, game, since Ermine had already make some folks discard, it seemed like a must, and the only link I wanted in play was Resonator for use with ongoing destruction.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Yep, rob, I also played Resonator turn 1 so I could have a floating ongoing destroyer, then used her base power. I might write down my route if I get time, I'm an iPad player so no easy log access.</p>",
