        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/c/d07c76/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2017-01-19T22:43:41.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Maybe the reason I never got any of the force discards that everyone is talking about is that I destroyed Ermine's Ongoing right away? &nbsp;Also learned the hard way that the link for the environment wasn't useful, as the first two rounds did not play gunmen. &nbsp;Though the gunman that came out after killed Friction for me, which was nice.</p>",
