        "created_at": "2017-01-20T16:03:30.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I think I received one forced discard, but yeah, they werent' bothering me all that much, and I also killed Constant Prattle immediately. (I hate that card so much)</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I don't often kill the card (there's usually higher priority Ongoings to kill), but I wanted to keep Engine of Destruction in (man, that hurt FT way more than it hurt me in this game.) when I used a first turn Disruptive Fleschettes.&nbsp;</p>",
